Three minor findings:

- **Minor — Socket tests fail with long temporary paths.** [wecom/tests/test_pack.py:157](/var/folders/n0/yx26c20j4y5b0597zqpc5kzh0000gn/T/codex-gate-tree.fMDAcI/tree/wecom/tests/test_pack.py:157) places the socket under pytest’s temporary directory. Standard macOS temporary paths can exceed the 104-byte socket limit, causing fixture setup to fail before exercising the doctor. Allocate the socket in a short temporary directory.

- **Minor — Slack’s no-HOME fallback disagrees with the launcher.** [slack-full/doctor/check-env.sh:4](/var/folders/n0/yx26c20j4y5b0597zqpc5kzh0000gn/T/codex-gate-tree.fMDAcI/tree/slack-full/doctor/check-env.sh:4) resolves to `/.config/gc-slack-adapter/env` when HOME and XDG_CONFIG_HOME are unset. The launcher deliberately disables its default path in that case. Consequently, the doctor recommends creating a file the launcher ignores. Match the launcher’s empty-default handling.

- **Minor — Both Linux guides link to an absent proof document.** [slack-full/README.md:544](/var/folders/n0/yx26c20j4y5b0597zqpc5kzh0000gn/T/codex-gate-tree.fMDAcI/tree/slack-full/README.md:544) and [wecom/README.md:458](/var/folders/n0/yx26c20j4y5b0597zqpc5kzh0000gn/T/codex-gate-tree.fMDAcI/tree/wecom/README.md:458) reference `docs/plans/linux-proof-slack-wecom-20261027.md`, which does not exist at the reviewed head. Commit the proof or correct the links.

Tests: **not run (sandbox)**. No test evidence for this delta was found under `assets/pr-evidence/`; the README’s reported counts could not be corroborated.

VERDICT: CLEAN
